{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266v48sNyeBU1794894712.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>教宗良十四世結束南美洲訪問行程。</p><p></p><p>教宗良十四世周一在秘魯總理加拉雷塔及外長埃斯帕陪同下，在首都利馬附近一個空軍基地出席歡送儀式。良十四世之後登上專機，啟程返回羅馬。他在艙門前向群眾揮手致意。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PERU.POPE-1130_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026i3ZUetwkeU1794894746.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>良十四世上月接受肺癌手術後，外界一度關注他能否展開南美訪問。秘魯是良十四世十二天南美行程的最後一站，被視為其第二故鄉，他此前也訪問了阿根廷及烏拉圭。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:09:10.869332+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T09:04:48.617117+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:02:33.901985+00:00","content_hash":"47547945399b40ec56a670a6a409c2c7ce4143a5879f3b94bc1f8c32ff8fa66e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:09:10.869332+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}